*> PLB-C047 foreign-index: an index of one table subscripts another
*> table whose elements have a different length.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FOREIGNIX.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  RATE-TABLE.
    05  RATE                PIC 9(3)V99 OCCURS 12 INDEXED BY RATE-IX.
01  NAME-TABLE.
    05  MONTH-NAME          PIC X(9) OCCURS 12 INDEXED BY NAME-IX.
01  CODE-TABLE.
    05  MONTH-CODE          PIC X(5) OCCURS 12 INDEXED BY CODE-IX.
01  GRID.
    05  GRID-ROW            OCCURS 4 INDEXED BY ROW-IX.
        10  GRID-CELL       PIC X(2) OCCURS 8 INDEXED BY CELL-IX.
01  WS-SUB                  PIC 9(2) VALUE 1.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    SET RATE-IX NAME-IX CODE-IX ROW-IX CELL-IX TO 1
    DISPLAY RATE(RATE-IX) MONTH-NAME(NAME-IX)
    DISPLAY MONTH-NAME(RATE-IX)
    DISPLAY MONTH-CODE(RATE-IX)
    DISPLAY MONTH-NAME(RATE-IX + 1)
    DISPLAY MONTH-NAME(WS-SUB)
    DISPLAY MONTH-NAME(RATE-IX +1) MONTH-NAME(NAME-IX - 1)
    DISPLAY GRID-CELL(ROW-IX, CELL-IX)
    DISPLAY GRID-CELL(CELL-IX, ROW-IX)
    DISPLAY GRID-CELL(ROW-IX CELL-IX)
    STOP RUN.
